# Demolition Field: its only target, Bazaar of Baghdad, is destroyed in response (Bot2's Wasteland), so the ability is
# countered on resolution for having no legal target (CR 608.2b) and none of it happens: no search is offered to anyone, and
# Bot1's own "you may search" is lost with it. Field is already sacrificed as a cost (CR 602.2b).

